<noinclude>
Old: stat tabs at the bottom of a character, NPC or creature page, from before they moved under the infobox.
Kept so those pages still show their stats, and listed in [[:Category:Pages with old stat blocks]].
To move one, in Edit source, put its <code>e5</code>, <code>e5_5</code>, <code>pf2</code> and <code>coc7</code> lines into the page's <code><nowiki>{{Character}}</nowiki></code>, <code><nowiki>{{NPC}}</nowiki></code> or <code><nowiki>{{Creature}}</nowiki></code>, then delete its <code><nowiki>{{Stats}}</nowiki></code> call.
A <code>stats</code> line holds blocks from before the per-system split: give each block its system's line.

